silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_02_sections_03_concrete_anchor_1#dietarycard5 silm:hasLongDescription "The DietaryCard5 is the printed dietary card numbered 5 issued by Dr. Mendez. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'DietaryCard5', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
